OL,3,GNEWSAMohamed Salah given six-month
OL,4,Adriving ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Liverpool footballer Mohamed
OL,7,FSalah has been banned from driving for
OL,8,Fsix months after his Rolls-Royce was
OL,9,Fclocked speeding.
OL,11,FSalah failed to tell police who was at
OL,12,Fthe wheel when the car was caught by a
OL,13,Fspeed camera driving at 36mph (58 km/h)
OL,14,Fon a 30mph (48km/h) stretch of road in
OL,15,FWilmslow, Cheshire, on 27 March,
OL,16,Faccording to court documents.
OL,18,FThe 34-year-old did not respond to the
OL,19,Fnotice of the prosecution, brought by
OL,20,FCheshire Police, and did not enter a
OL,21,Fplea to the charge.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
